### Run "Login: happy path"

### My bars
GET http://localhost:8080/bars
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### One bar
GET http://localhost:8080/bars/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### One bar's tables
GET http://localhost:8080/bars/1/tables
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Add a bar
POST http://localhost:8080/bars
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "barName": "New Spot",
  "address": "9 Rack Rd"
}

### Update a bar
PUT http://localhost:8080/bars/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "barName": "Carmelos (renamed)",
  "address": "1234 Main St"
}

### Delete a bar
DELETE http://localhost:8080/bars/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Bar id that isn't yours  403 / 404
GET http://localhost:8080/bars/999/tables
Authorization: {{authToken}}
